# Only add a value here when it is genuinely safe to publish. This file exists so the
# push guard stays credible: if it fired on known-public demo creds every time, it would
# get bypassed on reflex and stop protecting anything.
#
# Alternative for one-off cases: put `pragma: allowlist secret` on the line itself.

